        "failed_criteria": [
          "screen_based",
          "no_experimenter",
          "page_administrable",
          "apparatus_recovered"
        ],
        "why": "The ranking survey alone would be page-administrable, but it ranks five techniques the participant must first have experienced in the headset, and Sec. 4.2 pairs it with a brief open interview conducted by an experimenter. The qualitative themes in Sec. 5.8.1-5.8.5 come from that conversation; no interview guide or codebook was published."
