        "component": "O8 - participant demographics, prior-experience ratings, IRB consent and compensation (Sec. 4.4)",
        "servable": true,
        "failed_criteria": [],
        "why": "This one genuinely is servable. Consent, demographics and the four prior-experience items (VR, controllers, hands, gaze, each on a 6-point 0-5 scale) are a single-session, screen-based, self-administered form with no apparatus and no experimenter in the loop, and every response is captured in the browser. It would characterise a sample rather than reproduce any finding, and the exact item wording is not published, but nothing about the instrument's form blocks serving it."
      }
    ]
  },
